Qaimo Me Sitamgaron Ne Jab Aag Lagai<br>
<br>
Bimar Ko Zanjeer Pinata Hai Sitamgar<br>
Had Hogai Ab Zulm Ki Aur Joro Jafa Bhi<br>
<br>
